f)   Render annual professional maintenance fees to the CAICO;
            g) Sign annual renewal agreements with the CAICO;
            h) Disclose all relevant conflicts of interest, including where an appearance thereof
               may exist, to any company or organization employing or contracting you to instruct
               formal CMMC professional certification courses;
            i)   For Provisional Instructors, take the CCI professional certification examination
                 within 90 days of public release of the exam;
            j)   Refrain from knowingly and intentionally disseminating disinformation about the
                 CMMC Program, other members of the CMMC Ecosystem, The Cyber AB, and/or
                 the CAICO;
            k) Provide all documentation and records in English;
            l)   Provide the Accreditation Body and the CAICO with the most up-to-date and
                 accurate information detailing their qualifications, training experience, professional



